WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.042
Dan:
I need to be that guy

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:02.127
Dan:
one last time-

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.044
for us.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:04.754
[screaming and falling]

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.091
[music starts]

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:08.842
[bike bell ringing]

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:10.301
Oh hey Dan!

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:12.595
Happy Anniversary!

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:16.182
Dan, my husband, he's an amazing dad.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.934
Dan:
You're almost ready to
go a to size 4S, huh?

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.020
Ah, you so big. Look at the big musckuls.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.479
I just wish our lives were...

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:23.314
Jess:
Bigger.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.024
[glass cracks]

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:25.275
[kicks]

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:25.984
Really?

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.527
At least let me put my kid down.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:29.029
[fighting]

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:30.155
[cart crashes]

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:30.905
[baby laughing]

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:32.741
Store Employee:
Clean up on aisle 6.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:33.908
Sorry about the mess.

00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:34.909
[car screeches]

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.285
Hold on.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:37.620
[car drifting]

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.121
Oh hey Beau.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.414
Hey Dan.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:42.667
Don't hang up.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.169
I need new identities, I'm burned.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.712
Dan:
Me, my wife, and three kids.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.713
Have you told them yet?

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:49.007
I'll tell them when I'm on the road,
meet me in Vegas in three days.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:50.008
This is crazy!

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:52.177
Oh my God! We're going to Vegas!

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.763
-Woo!
-Oh, so pumped.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.556
Nothing brings the family
together like a road trip.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.311
Jess and Dan:
♪ Stop! Collaborate and listen! ♪

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:03.146
Jess and Dan:
♪ Ice is back with a brand new invention.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.105
Jess and Dan:
♪ Something grabs a hold of me tightly- ♪

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:04.647
Please stop.

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:05.440
[baby laughing]

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:08.526
Five hours on a plane or
thirty-three hours in a car?

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.320
Can someone unlock the car please?

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.031
[glass breaks]

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.282
Call in everybody.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.576
[engine revs]

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:18.203
McCaffrey:
I want him found.

00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:18.995
Baby Max:
Da-da.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:20.163
[assassin gagging]

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:22.207
[baby laughing]

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:22.791
What was that?!

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:23.583
A little pothole.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.001
Maxey has been up
the whole time by the way.

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:29.089
[gunshots breaking glass]

00:01:32.383 --> 00:01:34.094
[fighting]

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:34.427
Where's dad?

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.720
[kicking impacts]

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:38.598
Dan:
Before I met your mom I was
a covert assassin.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.100
I escaped that life and now they found us.

00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:42.102
[all laughing]

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:42.769
[gunshots]

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:44.562
What the-

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:48.608
Being your husband and their father,
that's the real me.

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:49.359
[engine revs]

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:49.692
[gunshot]

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.529
You're like James Bond in a minivan!

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:53.822
I love that minivan.

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:54.572
Da-da da-da.

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:55.240
[baby laughing]

00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:57.951
I need to be that guy one last time,
for us.

00:01:58.076 --> 00:01:59.410
[gunshots]

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:00.954
[fighting]

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:01.621
[screaming and falling]

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:02.997
♪ Ice ice baby ♪

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:04.833
Look at you playing the family man.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:05.583
Dan:
I'm not playing.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:06.417
This is my life.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:07.460
[cheering]

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:08.336
[gunshot and explosion]

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:09.379
Bang.

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:11.381
I'm kinda into spontaneous Dan.

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:14.551
Wait. wait.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:15.218
[baby laughing]

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:15.385
Go!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.555
[rapid diaper changing]

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:19.013
Mwa!

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:19.472
New record!

